WEBVTT

00:40.290 --> 00:45.003
ALCHEMY OF SOULS
PART 2

00:56.056 --> 00:59.225
Uk and Bu-yeon have promised
to go their separate ways.

00:59.726 --> 01:00.643
Mm.

01:01.227 --> 01:04.522
They said that, well,
there was no physical intimacy,

01:05.565 --> 01:07.776
it should be easy to end it.

01:07.859 --> 01:10.570
It's fortunate
they were not that close, I guess.

01:10.653 --> 01:11.780
Yeah, but…

01:12.655 --> 01:14.991
I remember them
drinking together at night.

01:15.075 --> 01:18.828
They came and told me explicitly
that their relationship was innocent

01:18.912 --> 01:21.081
and nothing serious would happen
between them at all.

02:23.935 --> 02:24.936
Just now…

02:25.812 --> 02:27.939
I felt the energy within you.

02:28.690 --> 02:29.566
The ice stone?

02:30.191 --> 02:31.025
Yeah.

02:32.944 --> 02:34.028
It was really strong.

02:34.112 --> 02:37.699
Do you think I'll actually
be able to take it out?

02:38.366 --> 02:39.742
I've always wanted to stop…

02:41.744 --> 02:43.329
but now I don't really want to.

02:44.914 --> 02:47.250
Don't… ever think like that.

02:50.795 --> 02:51.713
Even if you do,

02:53.590 --> 02:54.924
I will never do it for you.

02:58.761 --> 02:59.846
Sorry.

02:59.929 --> 03:00.763
And…

03:02.557 --> 03:03.391
thank you.

03:17.739 --> 03:20.658
Since we've stopped, let's think about
how to deal with this situation.

03:20.742 --> 03:24.245
Why? Is the light flickering?

03:33.379 --> 03:37.175
If we intend on staying together,
I must take back my promise.

03:38.343 --> 03:39.677
You did make that promise.

03:39.761 --> 03:43.640
Because Lord Park was also there
when I made the promise to Lady Jin.

03:44.140 --> 03:45.975
It's a promise
between Songrim and Jinyowon.

03:46.059 --> 03:49.687
That promise saved a life,
so it was… worth it.

03:49.771 --> 03:52.899
Yes, and I'll ask Lord Park
for his understanding

03:52.982 --> 03:54.776
and get your mother
to retract the promise we made.

03:54.859 --> 03:55.693
What? Really?

03:56.361 --> 03:58.071
Are you going to threaten my mother?

03:58.154 --> 04:00.782
I'll try to convince her,
just like everybody else.

04:06.454 --> 04:07.830
"I promise to be good to her."

04:08.373 --> 04:10.416
"So please allow me
to marry your daughter, Bu-yeon."

04:11.918 --> 04:12.877
So convincing!

04:15.713 --> 04:16.839
Convince me now, then.

04:18.174 --> 04:20.468
Not now, we must take care
of the situation first.

04:20.551 --> 04:21.928
If we end up distracted,

04:22.011 --> 04:23.972
we're only gonna lose our senses.

04:24.889 --> 04:28.393
Okay. We can do it later.
Let's sort things out.

04:31.604 --> 04:33.690
You've met my mother
a few times already, right?

04:34.607 --> 04:35.441
How was she?

04:41.823 --> 04:43.157
What did you just do?

04:43.241 --> 04:45.410
Is that what you consider love, Lady Jin?

04:45.493 --> 04:47.829
Poking somebody
with needles in a dark room?

04:53.960 --> 04:56.504
- Why did I mention needles?
- Needles? What?

04:56.587 --> 04:57.880
Nothing! It's nothing.

04:57.964 --> 05:00.300
If she pokes with needles,
I guess I'll just have to take it.

05:01.759 --> 05:03.886
Leaving you to do all this
may not be a good idea.

05:04.512 --> 05:06.848
For now, I think I should go back home.

05:06.931 --> 05:08.099
You're gonna leave?

05:09.350 --> 05:11.602
If I don't,
I'll only cause everyone trouble…

05:13.855 --> 05:15.606
and she'll hate you even more.

05:15.690 --> 05:18.276
Let me go home first
and make sure she's okay.

05:19.193 --> 05:20.153
Then I'll talk to her.

05:22.030 --> 05:23.239
Okay, go do that then.

05:23.948 --> 05:26.909
I'm going to talk to Lord Park
and come up with a solution.

05:36.419 --> 05:39.380
The soul of Naksu will disappear soon.

05:39.464 --> 05:42.800
Once the soul of Jin Bu-yeon,
the true owner of that body, awakens…

05:43.885 --> 05:46.679
Naksu's soul will no longer exist.

06:00.818 --> 06:02.612
Do you know where is Young Master Seo?

06:02.695 --> 06:04.030
He left this morning.

06:04.572 --> 06:08.117
He said that he needed to speak
with Lord Park about something. Excuse me.

06:15.541 --> 06:17.001
He must have gone to…

06:18.127 --> 06:19.670
tell them what's written here.

06:19.754 --> 06:22.298
Will everyone soon know that Jin Bu-yeon…

06:24.509 --> 06:25.927
is really Naksu?

06:33.142 --> 06:35.353
Jang Uk,
come home every night now.

06:35.436 --> 06:37.021
- Don't stay here.
- Mm.

06:37.105 --> 06:39.565
And tell Maidservant Kim
that I'll be back soon, okay?

06:39.649 --> 06:40.733
I will.

06:41.734 --> 06:44.570
Ah, in my room,
I left honey biscuits for you.

06:44.654 --> 06:45.488
Eat them, please.

06:45.571 --> 06:47.031
- Honey biscuits?
- Yes.

06:47.115 --> 06:49.700
I heard they were your favorite,
so I often bought some for you.

06:49.784 --> 06:51.452
- About how many?
- A lot.

06:51.536 --> 06:53.371
You'll trip if you don't walk forward.

06:54.580 --> 06:57.542
I won't see you for a while,
so I want to look at your face.

06:59.210 --> 07:01.421
There's not a single place
in this world that I cannot go,

07:02.004 --> 07:04.298
but I don't want your mother
to hate me more than she does.

07:04.966 --> 07:05.967
Just hang on a bit, all right?

07:07.844 --> 07:09.053
See me in secret!

07:09.137 --> 07:10.805
Climb over the wall like Seo Yul did.

07:11.556 --> 07:13.391
You sound a little too excited
for something like that.

07:17.395 --> 07:20.857
By the way, how did you manage
to find my room the first time?

07:21.941 --> 07:23.734
I mean the door is hard to recognize.

07:24.485 --> 07:25.319
Door?

07:27.113 --> 07:28.322
What's this?

07:29.365 --> 07:32.118
It was already open
as if someone wanted me to come in.

07:33.369 --> 07:34.370
It was just open?

07:35.830 --> 07:38.916
It likely must have broken open
while I was fighting.

07:39.000 --> 07:40.460
That's also why
the barrier probably broke.

07:41.210 --> 07:42.253
Hmm.

07:43.713 --> 07:46.549
Then what did you think of me when we met?

07:47.133 --> 07:48.926
Hmm.

07:49.010 --> 07:51.387
That you're odd
because you were locked up,

07:51.888 --> 07:52.805
and suspicious too.

07:53.639 --> 07:55.475
I liked you even from the start.

07:57.685 --> 07:59.437
I knew when I saw you.

08:00.396 --> 08:01.272
You're my husband.

08:15.036 --> 08:16.287
I knew when I saw you.

08:18.414 --> 08:19.457
You are my master.

08:33.471 --> 08:34.722
You felt the same way.

08:35.389 --> 08:37.058
Yes, because her blue marks…

08:38.559 --> 08:40.144
blossomed like flowers in her eyes.

08:45.066 --> 08:45.900
I don't…

08:46.692 --> 08:48.861
care you didn't recognize me when we met.

08:51.531 --> 08:52.657
As this time…

08:55.743 --> 08:56.994
I recognized you first.

09:08.256 --> 09:09.131
Let's go.

09:16.222 --> 09:19.725
You should be resting.
What was it that could not wait?

09:19.809 --> 09:21.561
There's something
I must take responsibility for.

09:21.644 --> 09:24.772
Is it something that I should also hear?

09:25.523 --> 09:26.524
What is it?

09:26.607 --> 09:29.026
Because it concerns
Jin Bu-yeon and Jang Uk as well.

09:29.110 --> 09:32.572
Goodness, Yul, that boy!

09:34.782 --> 09:35.825
Grandfather.

09:36.450 --> 09:39.495
Has Young Master Seo told you anything?

09:40.079 --> 09:43.708
Uh, Jin Bu-yeon,
he said something about her,

09:43.791 --> 09:46.419
saying that he wants to be responsible.

09:48.838 --> 09:51.424
The promise with Lady Jin
was made in order to save my life,

09:51.507 --> 09:53.843
so I will go to her myself
and have her annul it.

09:58.681 --> 10:00.683
Was that all Yul said?

10:01.475 --> 10:03.644
He didn't say anything else about her?

10:03.728 --> 10:04.770
Yun-ok, I…

10:05.479 --> 10:10.151
told you before, time and again
not to mind whatever Jang Uk does.

10:10.860 --> 10:12.361
Don't even be curious.

10:20.161 --> 10:21.829
Naksu wasn't mentioned?

10:24.081 --> 10:26.375
Even after he planned
to kill her at Danhyanggok?

10:28.711 --> 10:30.296
Cho-yeon left by herself?

10:30.379 --> 10:33.049
Yes, Young Master Seo asked her
to go alone.

10:35.426 --> 10:36.385
Seo Yul?

10:37.178 --> 10:39.555
Uh, what would Yul say, you think,

10:39.639 --> 10:41.932
to convince Lady Ho-gyeong
to go along with that?

10:42.016 --> 10:43.142
I don't know.

10:43.934 --> 10:47.897
He had just said that
my mother would wait if I told her

10:47.980 --> 10:52.026
that he would visit her very soon
so he can tell her what he knows.

10:52.109 --> 10:52.943
Hmm.

10:54.111 --> 10:55.696
He's not one to speak rashly,

10:56.280 --> 10:57.907
so that means it will most likely work.

10:59.325 --> 11:01.702
Should I ask him to mention
our relationship to your mother as well?

11:01.786 --> 11:05.164
We shouldn't get involved with them.
She really dislikes Jang Uk,

11:06.248 --> 11:08.834
but she does not dislike you though.

11:11.045 --> 11:11.879
I don't know

11:12.755 --> 11:14.799
why she seems to disapprove of Uk so much.

11:18.177 --> 11:20.638
Because it's painful
to see someone she hates…

11:22.932 --> 11:23.891
be happy.

11:26.352 --> 11:29.146
Yul said he'll meet Lady Jin

11:29.230 --> 11:31.899
and try to get her to annul the promise.

11:31.982 --> 11:33.442
Yul truly is amazing.

11:33.526 --> 11:35.695
He's helping out a friend
as soon as he wakes up.

11:37.029 --> 11:39.448
I told him,
"Uk has already made up his mind."

11:40.074 --> 11:42.368
"Don't get involved until you're well."

11:43.577 --> 11:44.745
So I stopped him.

11:45.996 --> 11:48.791
But why would you stop him?
All he's doing is helping out a friend.

11:49.375 --> 11:51.460
You said you're giving up though,
did you not, Uk?

11:53.713 --> 11:55.089
My lord!

11:57.717 --> 12:01.303
If Young Master Seo helps, are you willing
to try and convince Lady Jin, huh?

12:03.514 --> 12:07.768
I tried to marry her daughter, Bu-yeon,
without even asking her permission first,

12:07.852 --> 12:09.103
so she has every right to be mad.

12:10.062 --> 12:12.356
For now, I plan
to ease some of that hatred.

12:23.409 --> 12:24.243
I heard the news.

12:24.994 --> 12:26.495
Thank you for helping us.

12:27.830 --> 12:29.457
Well, it's my fault this happened.

12:29.540 --> 12:31.041
Still, I'm grateful.

12:31.792 --> 12:33.961
You may have realized this from last time,

12:34.044 --> 12:36.297
but before, there was no room
for me in his heart.

12:36.380 --> 12:39.633
However, now, I finally get
to stay by his side.

12:40.217 --> 12:41.302
Isn't that great?

12:46.766 --> 12:47.600
I'm not sure.

12:49.185 --> 12:50.936
You two will cause each other great pain.

12:52.354 --> 12:54.523
Why would you say that though?

12:55.608 --> 12:57.234
We are supposed to be friends, Yul.

13:00.112 --> 13:00.946
Friends?

13:02.948 --> 13:05.576
If you were aware of what I had planned
to do at Danhyanggok…

13:07.745 --> 13:09.330
you wouldn't smile and call me a friend.

13:10.956 --> 13:13.167
You look so unhappy now.

13:15.127 --> 13:16.545
Are you in pain still?

13:18.464 --> 13:19.298
Yes.

13:19.381 --> 13:20.508
I'm still hurt.

13:22.426 --> 13:24.637
It must have been
because of the terrible dream.

13:25.554 --> 13:26.806
Did you have a bad dream?

13:28.224 --> 13:30.476
I dreamt of disappearing
together with someone…

13:32.561 --> 13:34.313
who I've cherished for a very long time.

13:38.484 --> 13:40.903
But when I woke up
from the dream, it turns out that…

13:42.655 --> 13:44.615
I'll remain
while that person will disappear.

13:48.244 --> 13:50.079
I feel angry and also disheartened.

13:51.622 --> 13:53.833
But mostly,
my heart aches for them so much.

13:56.252 --> 13:57.878
I'm filled with much sadness.

14:02.216 --> 14:05.302
All of my memories
of Danhyanggok are wonderful.

14:09.682 --> 14:10.683
Yul, have…

14:12.852 --> 14:15.271
have you and I met before at Danhyanggok?

14:19.441 --> 14:21.694
You said if you went to Danhyanggok,
you'd find yourself.

14:23.028 --> 14:25.781
Go and find out who you really are.

14:25.865 --> 14:28.200
Then you'll realize
what I'd planned to do there…

14:29.451 --> 14:31.579
and why you and Uk will
only end up causing…

14:33.789 --> 14:34.748
each other pain.

14:37.626 --> 14:38.836
I don't want to know.

14:39.962 --> 14:41.755
I won't go there if that's the case.

14:43.340 --> 14:45.134
If the real me can't be with Jang Uk…

14:46.886 --> 14:48.053
I don't want to know.

14:51.640 --> 14:53.017
You'll eventually discover…

14:57.062 --> 14:58.105
who you are anyway.

14:58.188 --> 14:59.189
You asked me…

15:00.691 --> 15:02.776
to feign total ignorance
when you could have died, Yul.

15:04.612 --> 15:06.071
I ask the same of you now.

15:06.155 --> 15:07.364
Please forget about it.

15:19.960 --> 15:21.545
Your foolish friend will give you time.

15:23.047 --> 15:24.173
But if you ever need me at all…

15:25.966 --> 15:27.134
please come find me.

15:58.624 --> 15:59.500
Young Lady.

16:01.377 --> 16:02.378
I heard the news.

16:03.170 --> 16:04.380
I'm very happy for you.

16:05.130 --> 16:06.799
Right, thanks.

16:07.383 --> 16:09.009
Young Master Jang even asked

16:09.093 --> 16:12.096
Lord Park to convince your mother
to change her mind.

16:12.680 --> 16:13.639
Is that so?

16:13.722 --> 16:16.642
I knew things would work out.

16:17.142 --> 16:20.479
I'm very glad that
you are the one beside him.

16:21.063 --> 16:22.022
Do you think that…

16:23.732 --> 16:26.360
it will be okay to stay by Uk?

16:26.443 --> 16:27.653
Of course.

16:28.153 --> 16:31.865
Now all that's left is to prepare
for the wedding we've been waiting for.

16:32.574 --> 16:33.534
Hmm.

16:33.617 --> 16:36.662
Oh, Young Master Jang is meeting
someone from the palace right now.

16:36.745 --> 16:38.455
Let us head home first.

16:39.331 --> 16:40.624
- Let's.
- Come.

16:46.130 --> 16:48.632
Today, His Royal Majesty will be
summoning you.

16:49.216 --> 16:51.093
But the Crown Prince wishes
to see you first.

16:54.555 --> 16:56.473
Inside this chest is an item
that belongs to him.

16:56.557 --> 16:59.768
If you possess the same item, he wants you
to bring it with you when you see him.

17:01.395 --> 17:04.106
You must open it
when absolutely no one is around you.

17:17.703 --> 17:22.124
This is the Gold Plaque that the King left
for his son who will succeed him.

17:22.207 --> 17:23.542
What's he playing at?

17:32.259 --> 17:33.844
Is that the King's Star I see?

17:33.927 --> 17:37.639
He's a dangerous star
who's ready to take your place anytime.

17:40.434 --> 17:41.351
Royal Highness.

17:42.227 --> 17:43.812
I visited Uk and invited him.

17:44.730 --> 17:45.564
Good.

17:47.858 --> 17:49.777
As for the turtle,
I couldn't find it anywhere.

17:50.402 --> 17:51.528
I suppose he's gone now.

17:54.782 --> 17:57.910
Lord Dang-gu gave orders
to collect her body and hold a funeral,

17:57.993 --> 18:01.830
but this young man kicked up a fuss,
insisting that you come see her.

18:01.914 --> 18:03.165
Um…

18:03.248 --> 18:05.375
she wanted to make sure
that you were doing all right.

18:07.878 --> 18:09.421
I am sure she is happy now.

18:14.885 --> 18:16.512
- What is that?
- Uh…

18:17.679 --> 18:20.933
it was something she cherished dearly.

18:21.725 --> 18:25.020
I don't know why she treasured
an umbrella she never used when it rained.

18:39.201 --> 18:41.078
Does she have any family
who can hold a funeral?

18:41.161 --> 18:43.122
Uh… no.

18:44.206 --> 18:46.250
She said the world she knew
was filthy and dirty.

18:46.333 --> 18:49.002
You were the only clean
and bright thing in it.

18:51.630 --> 18:54.174
Please find a place
that's warm and full of sunlight for her.

18:55.884 --> 18:57.386
I will set up a funeral in her honor.

18:58.679 --> 18:59.680
Yes.

19:10.107 --> 19:12.818
I thought I was seeing
all those memories because of this.

19:13.610 --> 19:14.903
But was I wrong?

19:16.572 --> 19:17.489
What could they be?

19:18.240 --> 19:19.575
Then you'll realize why you and Uk

19:19.658 --> 19:21.285
will only end up causing each other pain.

19:23.370 --> 19:25.414
Will I find out if I go to Danhyanggok?

19:28.208 --> 19:31.086
Young Lady.
Young Master Jang just got here.

19:38.177 --> 19:39.011
Jang Uk.

19:40.804 --> 19:41.805
Hey.

19:43.265 --> 19:45.475
I've got to go to the palace
right now for an urgent matter.

19:45.559 --> 19:46.435
I won't take too much time.

19:47.186 --> 19:48.020
Hmm.

19:52.399 --> 19:53.609
I need to get changed now.

19:54.401 --> 19:55.444
Are you gonna keep staring?

19:58.906 --> 20:00.699
No, we can't.
We keep the light on for now.

20:05.078 --> 20:08.916
Is that scar from being stabbed with that?

20:13.712 --> 20:14.546
Yes.

20:17.716 --> 20:18.550
So what…

20:20.093 --> 20:21.637
you were dying to know was how…

20:23.889 --> 20:25.057
she felt in that moment?

20:27.184 --> 20:30.979
Everyone said that she did this
to avenge her family.

20:32.231 --> 20:34.566
But still, I just couldn't know

20:35.609 --> 20:36.610
if she truly…

20:37.736 --> 20:38.987
went easy on me or not.

20:40.739 --> 20:41.823
Such a sad…

20:43.867 --> 20:45.035
and terrible scar.

20:52.334 --> 20:54.419
I don't wish to see
the memory of that moment.

20:56.463 --> 20:57.297
Wait.

20:58.090 --> 20:59.716
So you've still been seeing
those memories?

21:00.300 --> 21:03.262
I think I don't want to see
someone else's memories.

21:03.345 --> 21:05.389
They are hers, not mine.

21:05.472 --> 21:07.349
You said you'd remember who you were

21:07.933 --> 21:09.601
if you saw that tree in Danhyanggok.

21:09.685 --> 21:11.061
- Should we go soon?
- I can't.

21:11.979 --> 21:13.563
I think I was confused about that.

21:14.064 --> 21:14.982
We shouldn't go.

21:16.858 --> 21:18.652
You should finish
getting changed and go now.

21:21.738 --> 21:23.657
Okay. Wait for me here.

21:25.450 --> 21:28.203
Okay, I'll be waiting.

21:28.287 --> 21:30.080
Hmm…

21:30.706 --> 21:31.623
what is it?

21:32.124 --> 21:34.626
I can tell you were feeling
elated earlier for sure…

21:36.336 --> 21:37.671
…but now you seem a little bit down.

21:39.840 --> 21:42.175
It's just hard for me to believe
that you told me to wait.

21:42.759 --> 21:45.971
Because you always tell me to leave
or never come home at all.

21:46.972 --> 21:47.889
You remember?

21:55.897 --> 21:57.774
Don't go anywhere and wait here, okay?

22:00.152 --> 22:00.986
Uh-huh.

22:02.571 --> 22:05.574
I will quickly be by your side again.

22:17.753 --> 22:19.004
And I promise you…

22:21.173 --> 22:22.799
I'll always be by yours.

22:34.061 --> 22:36.063
You were looking for Young Master Seo.
Did you see him?

22:36.146 --> 22:37.981
- I just saw him leave.
- It's fine.

22:39.149 --> 22:40.317
I'll just do it.

22:46.948 --> 22:48.742
- Here it is.
- What is that for?

22:50.744 --> 22:52.579
It's used on corpses.

22:53.205 --> 22:54.664
It shows hidden scars.

22:54.748 --> 22:58.543
The blue mark of a soul shifter's scar.
If you apply it, it'll show.

22:59.336 --> 23:01.004
So how do you plan to use it?

23:04.299 --> 23:06.051
She said she didn't want to know.

23:09.763 --> 23:11.264
So I plan to reveal it.

23:14.643 --> 23:16.478
You survived thanks to me.

23:16.561 --> 23:18.772
Now you come over here
to threaten me with her secret?

23:18.855 --> 23:21.483
If it sounded like a threat,
then so be it.

23:22.484 --> 23:24.945
And don't try to keep Naksu
locked up in Jinyowon anymore.

23:25.028 --> 23:27.739
Then you're saying
I should let her stay with Jang Uk?

23:27.823 --> 23:30.867
If that's what she wants to do,
I'm going to help her do that.

23:30.951 --> 23:32.119
Then that leaves me…

23:33.328 --> 23:36.164
no reason to keep Naksu alive anymore.

23:36.248 --> 23:37.791
You must stop thinking like that.

23:39.167 --> 23:40.502
That's why your daughter, Jin Bu-yeon,

23:41.711 --> 23:43.171
will be able to return.

23:43.755 --> 23:44.589
What?

23:46.675 --> 23:48.176
My daughter, Bu-yeon, will return?

23:49.469 --> 23:50.512
What do you mean?

23:50.595 --> 23:52.431
Naksu's soul will soon disappear,

23:53.098 --> 23:55.308
and that body will solely
belong to Jin Bu-yeon.

23:56.601 --> 23:58.061
That is what Master Lee told me.

23:58.645 --> 24:01.982
He told me her soul was gone forever.

24:02.691 --> 24:05.944
So then, has he been deceiving me?

24:06.027 --> 24:07.362
Please ask him yourself.

24:09.531 --> 24:10.449
Just let her…

24:11.616 --> 24:12.909
stay where she wishes

24:13.910 --> 24:15.495
with the person she wishes to be with…

24:17.539 --> 24:18.623
even if it's brief.

24:20.876 --> 24:22.085
This is obviously a threat…

24:25.255 --> 24:26.506
but it is a plea as well.

24:51.239 --> 24:52.282
Why are you empty-handed?

24:52.365 --> 24:53.825
Why didn't you bring what I asked?

24:54.826 --> 24:55.744
Do you not have the same?

24:55.827 --> 24:58.163
I didn't bring it
as it did not seem necessary.

24:58.246 --> 24:59.581
If you didn't bring it,

25:00.665 --> 25:02.584
then I will assume
you at least have it, right?

25:02.667 --> 25:05.086
The fact that you know
I possess it means you also

25:05.170 --> 25:08.131
know how it was that I came to be
in this world, Your Royal Highness.

25:13.720 --> 25:15.847
If you do not intend
to fight me over the Gold Plaque,

25:16.431 --> 25:18.099
go up north, Jang Uk.

25:19.809 --> 25:22.062
I will hide behind Jin Mu
just like you said,

25:22.979 --> 25:24.439
and you will have to go far away.

25:32.030 --> 25:35.325
I, Jang Uk of the Jang family, will go
to the North Fortress as commanded.

25:35.408 --> 25:37.410
Thank you for honoring my command.

25:37.494 --> 25:40.956
Waste no time
and go get ready to leave soon, all right?

25:46.419 --> 25:49.798
I had planned to threaten
Park Jin of Songrim to pressure Jang Uk.

25:49.881 --> 25:52.634
But I had no idea that
you would reveal the Gold Plaque

25:52.717 --> 25:54.678
in order to compel him to bend.

25:57.931 --> 26:00.308
I realized something
when I was going up against him.

26:00.892 --> 26:03.353
Jang Uk does not fight in order to gain,

26:04.312 --> 26:06.064
but rather he'd fight so he can protect.

26:06.982 --> 26:08.942
Therefore, if I challenged him
over the plaque…

26:10.944 --> 26:14.447
instead of fighting against me,
he would back down to protect.

26:17.033 --> 26:19.244
Park Jin of Songrim
also couldn't do anything

26:19.869 --> 26:21.371
to protect Jang Uk at all.

26:23.623 --> 26:26.501
They're faint-hearted
who fail to do what is necessary,

26:27.210 --> 26:28.795
restrained by a sense of justice.

26:34.426 --> 26:35.510
I see now.

26:39.055 --> 26:39.889
Gwanju.

26:39.973 --> 26:43.310
Ever since a few days ago,
I can't seem to find my turtle anywhere.

26:46.479 --> 26:49.816
It's a weak animal
that doesn't suit you, Royal Highness.

26:50.567 --> 26:53.528
Don't allow yourself
to cling to such things.

26:55.071 --> 26:56.364
Did you try to get rid of it…

26:57.824 --> 26:59.451
so I could shed my weakness?

27:01.870 --> 27:03.246
Do you wish to find it again?

27:08.585 --> 27:09.419
I don't.

27:09.502 --> 27:12.922
I just think it's a shame
because I was told it had good energy.

27:13.006 --> 27:16.301
If it's an animal with good energy
you seek, there's a peacock in the garden.

27:16.384 --> 27:20.347
They're animals that merely exist
for our own amusement.

27:21.056 --> 27:22.807
Hmm.

27:25.268 --> 27:26.144
I guess you're right.

27:40.867 --> 27:43.536
So you have agreed
to go to North Fortress?

27:43.620 --> 27:46.498
Yes, I have decided to go, my lord.

27:47.415 --> 27:49.250
I'm actually very concerned

27:49.334 --> 27:52.045
that they may be plotting
to do something while you are far away.

27:52.128 --> 27:54.297
The Crown Prince showed me
his Gold Plaque and asked

27:55.256 --> 27:56.925
if I'd be willing
to start a fight for him.

27:58.218 --> 28:00.845
If I decide to participate in this fight,

28:02.013 --> 28:05.266
would you also be willing to
stand behind me as you did last time?

28:05.350 --> 28:07.727
What is it
you wish to protect in this fight?

28:09.437 --> 28:11.356
And what is it you're aiming to fight for?

28:13.066 --> 28:15.276
Are you making this decision
after giving it much thought?

28:15.860 --> 28:18.363
Yes, I have taken precise aim

28:19.155 --> 28:21.199
and have ultimately decided
to accept this fight

28:22.325 --> 28:23.618
to protect what I must.

28:29.416 --> 28:30.291
What brings you here?

28:30.792 --> 28:32.335
Young Lady Heo has asked to see you now.

28:33.503 --> 28:34.838
Is she inviting me to Sejukwon?

28:34.921 --> 28:36.047
I don't know.

28:36.131 --> 28:38.883
She wants you to meet her
where Young Master Jang frequently visits.

28:43.513 --> 28:45.682
We received a message from Seoho Fortress.

28:45.765 --> 28:47.976
Your father is very worried about you.

28:49.894 --> 28:51.479
I'll make sure
to write him a letter myself.

28:51.563 --> 28:54.899
Ah. We should have asked
Lord Park to take the letter

28:55.483 --> 28:57.944
that was in your belongings
he got from your home.

28:58.945 --> 29:01.114
Did you see the letter
that was within my belongings?

29:01.197 --> 29:04.117
Yes, Young Lady Heo had brought
the letter to me.

29:10.498 --> 29:11.624
Where's Young Lady Yun-ok?

29:15.086 --> 29:16.838
Why did you ask me to meet you here?

29:19.048 --> 29:19.966
I heard that

29:20.759 --> 29:23.261
Young Master Jang built this
as a graveyard

29:23.344 --> 29:24.888
since he started killing soul shifters.

29:25.764 --> 29:29.642
There should be a grave here
for Naksu, the one who killed him.

29:32.979 --> 29:34.272
It's that one?

29:36.024 --> 29:38.526
You said you don't remember
who you are, right?

29:39.110 --> 29:40.195
Are you not curious at all?

29:40.278 --> 29:41.654
What concern is it to you, Yun-ok?

29:41.738 --> 29:42.906
I've become curious.

29:45.116 --> 29:47.160
So I came to confirm my theory.

29:49.913 --> 29:50.872
What is that?

29:52.165 --> 29:53.333
No need to worry.

29:53.416 --> 29:55.293
I would never harm anyone.

29:55.376 --> 29:57.796
I only try to ascertain things

29:58.296 --> 29:59.464
that are still unknown.

30:07.764 --> 30:10.016
- The blue mark should be here.
- What are you doing?

30:24.030 --> 30:26.032
- Young Master.
- What do you think you're doing?

30:27.742 --> 30:28.576
Are you okay, Bu-yeon?

30:28.660 --> 30:29.661
Yeah, I'm all right.

30:30.620 --> 30:31.996
Why did you have to splash that on me?

30:32.080 --> 30:34.123
- Because you're a soul shift--
- Hey, enough.

30:35.542 --> 30:37.710
If you're doing this
because of my letter, just stop it.

30:38.294 --> 30:39.712
I'll explain everything.

30:44.133 --> 30:45.802
You should hurry up and find some water,

30:45.885 --> 30:47.637
and wash off that medicine
that got on you.

30:47.720 --> 30:48.638
Okay then.

30:57.272 --> 30:58.982
I assume you read my letter.

31:00.024 --> 31:00.859
Yeah.

31:00.942 --> 31:03.236
If everything in that letter is true,

31:03.319 --> 31:05.154
why are you letting her be then?

31:05.780 --> 31:07.156
She's Naksu, isn't she?

31:24.591 --> 31:26.467
Yes, because her blue marks

31:27.302 --> 31:29.012
blossomed like flowers in her eyes.

31:41.983 --> 31:42.901
Is that…

31:45.904 --> 31:46.821
really me?

31:48.489 --> 31:52.327
That woman is someone who has hurt
Young Master Jang very deeply.

31:52.410 --> 31:55.413
I couldn't bear to see him
get hurt again by her.

31:55.496 --> 31:56.748
She should leave.

31:57.790 --> 31:58.958
She should know who she is.

32:02.420 --> 32:03.838
Even if you don't let her know…

32:05.924 --> 32:07.258
that soul will soon disappear.

32:11.179 --> 32:12.221
I just wanted…

32:15.224 --> 32:17.143
her to stay like this a bit longer.

32:42.043 --> 32:43.419
My crazy master…

32:46.089 --> 32:47.840
I guess you've poisoned me again.

33:28.673 --> 33:29.716
So it's over there.

33:33.636 --> 33:35.096
I've been in this place before.

33:35.680 --> 33:36.723
Do you want to go up?

33:38.975 --> 33:39.809
All right.

33:40.435 --> 33:43.604
I promise I will take you
all the way to the top.

33:46.357 --> 33:47.984
I knew the moment I saw you.

33:48.067 --> 33:49.277
My crazy master.

33:51.237 --> 33:53.322
I have no need
for a pupil who won't improve.

33:53.406 --> 33:55.533
If you're not going to do anything,
you should just die.

33:56.284 --> 33:57.869
Master! Master!

33:58.494 --> 33:59.620
You are my master.

34:01.706 --> 34:03.291
Master, I finally did it.

34:03.916 --> 34:05.001
Bird's eggs.

34:05.084 --> 34:06.210
I also missed you.

34:08.171 --> 34:09.756
Jang Uk, I like you a lot.

34:10.548 --> 34:11.466
Just one.

34:12.258 --> 34:15.553
You are the only one. I will wear it
on my hand for the rest of my life.

34:19.140 --> 34:20.725
They were all my memories.

34:25.730 --> 34:27.440
I was the owner of this blue jade.

34:29.400 --> 34:31.069
And I was his master…

34:33.488 --> 34:34.363
Naksu.

35:01.390 --> 35:03.559
You must be Jin Bu-yeon,
the owner of this body.

35:04.185 --> 35:06.104
I see you have finally realized

35:06.646 --> 35:08.064
who you actually are now.

35:09.107 --> 35:10.149
What a shame!

35:10.233 --> 35:12.819
If only you'd found out
when my powers fully returned,

35:13.569 --> 35:16.489
you'd been able to leave
without any sadness at all.

35:18.491 --> 35:21.786
Thanks to you, my body has
become whole without running wild.

35:22.662 --> 35:24.664
I've gained most of my powers as well.

35:25.623 --> 35:27.416
You'll have to leave this body…

35:28.835 --> 35:30.002
for it's not yours.

35:39.679 --> 35:41.556
Someone from Sejukwon came to see her?

35:41.639 --> 35:42.557
Yes.

35:42.640 --> 35:44.851
Then she was at Sejukwon?

35:44.934 --> 35:48.479
Um, no, I offered to take her there
if that was where she was going.

35:48.563 --> 35:50.022
But she went somewhere else instead.

35:51.399 --> 35:52.567
All right, thank you.

36:00.241 --> 36:02.201
Where did she go? She said she'd wait.

36:11.586 --> 36:12.545
It's gone.

36:15.006 --> 36:17.049
My memories are confused because of it.

36:17.633 --> 36:20.511
If I see it, I'm sure
it will help me figure things out.

36:20.595 --> 36:22.221
So did she really go there?

36:23.514 --> 36:24.724
But why though?

36:33.357 --> 36:35.568
This is where
they first met each other.

36:36.277 --> 36:38.279
And this is where he proposed to her.

37:04.764 --> 37:06.766
Um…

37:07.266 --> 37:09.560
is, uh, Young Lady doing okay?

37:13.022 --> 37:15.942
Please send someone to Uk's house
and tell them that Bu-yeon is here.

37:39.423 --> 37:40.258
Okay, there you are.

37:43.511 --> 37:44.887
How come you didn't wait for me?

37:44.971 --> 37:47.515
I almost went to Danhyanggok,
thinking you might have gone by yourself.

37:49.684 --> 37:50.685
Actually, I did go there.

37:53.312 --> 37:54.230
And I…

37:57.316 --> 37:58.859
I discovered who I really am.

38:16.377 --> 38:18.587
You mean you somehow
remembered your lost memories?

38:20.589 --> 38:21.424
Correct.

38:28.014 --> 38:30.516
Then what were you doing here
instead of coming back home?

38:31.142 --> 38:32.852
I was waiting
and I had to come looking for you.

38:33.811 --> 38:35.771
I said I'd wait. I feel bad now.

38:38.733 --> 38:39.650
But now…

38:40.693 --> 38:42.028
I can't wait for you.

38:43.821 --> 38:45.865
I remembered something very important.

38:48.451 --> 38:49.702
I'll tell you this much.

38:50.786 --> 38:53.581
No matter what kind of person you were
and all the memories you lost,

38:54.874 --> 38:55.875
it doesn't matter anymore.

38:59.295 --> 39:00.463
I'm telling you that…

39:01.672 --> 39:03.883
- I'm all right with it, Bu-yeon.
- Well, I'm not all right with it.

39:07.386 --> 39:08.888
Because the memories I regained…

39:13.851 --> 39:15.561
were of someone I liked very much.

39:17.855 --> 39:18.814
You always manage…

39:20.900 --> 39:23.486
to catch me completely off guard
by some of the things you say.

39:25.237 --> 39:26.655
- So then?
- But…

39:29.367 --> 39:31.577
he can't recognize me,
even when I'm in front of him.

39:33.621 --> 39:34.455
Really?

39:38.292 --> 39:40.753
Then you should have told him
so he can recognize you.

39:43.005 --> 39:43.881
I cannot do that.

39:45.800 --> 39:48.260
Because I've hurt
this person far too much that I…

39:50.596 --> 39:51.764
just can't talk to him…

39:54.308 --> 39:55.476
or even go near him.

39:59.063 --> 40:01.023
I feel too guilty
to stay by your side like this.

40:01.524 --> 40:02.608
I shall go to Jinyowon.

40:03.484 --> 40:04.735
No, wait. Wait!

40:07.405 --> 40:08.697
You're just gonna leave like this?

40:08.781 --> 40:10.074
You said you'd wait!

40:10.950 --> 40:13.160
And now you're gonna leave
just because you remembered someone?

40:14.328 --> 40:15.830
Am I supposed to say "Oh, right,"

40:16.539 --> 40:17.998
and wish you a happy future
with that person?

40:19.500 --> 40:20.418
I mean, come on!

40:21.669 --> 40:23.587
Don't go to him, he can't recognize you.

40:28.801 --> 40:29.718
But I really…

40:33.347 --> 40:34.640
did like him very much.

40:41.021 --> 40:43.023
I actually liked him
more than he liked me.

40:45.901 --> 40:47.903
But I never once
got the chance to tell him that.

41:04.462 --> 41:05.296
Jang Uk.

41:08.340 --> 41:09.383
You can turn the light on.

41:10.259 --> 41:13.637
And let me go as you promised
you would if I said I would leave.

41:28.527 --> 41:29.570
I'm sorry.

41:49.798 --> 41:50.633
Mother.

41:50.716 --> 41:52.343
Bu-yeon has just come home.

41:52.426 --> 41:54.845
Bu-yeon's here?

42:17.660 --> 42:18.494
Mother.

42:19.870 --> 42:20.913
I've returned home…

42:22.456 --> 42:23.707
just as I promised.

42:31.423 --> 42:33.342
Is it true
Young Lady Jin went back to Jinyowon?

42:34.009 --> 42:36.095
Why? She said she was going to stay.

42:36.929 --> 42:38.472
I heard Lady Jin isn't well.

42:38.973 --> 42:40.516
Did she leave because she's worried?

42:41.684 --> 42:42.935
She wants to stay there for now.

42:43.018 --> 42:44.144
Do not worry.

42:44.228 --> 42:45.062
Hmm.

42:47.064 --> 42:49.942
Hmm, is Lady Jin's condition that bad?

42:50.609 --> 42:52.027
Your room is ready for you.

42:52.111 --> 42:53.779
Why do you want to stay here?

42:54.780 --> 42:56.323
This place is more familiar.

42:57.783 --> 42:59.285
And I don't want to see anyone.

43:00.619 --> 43:01.829
Don't worry for me.

43:15.676 --> 43:18.137
I heard that you'll be heading north soon.

43:18.762 --> 43:19.597
Yeah.

43:20.556 --> 43:23.726
I've already discussed the matter
with Lord Park as well, so do not worry.

43:24.476 --> 43:25.311
Yeah.

43:26.812 --> 43:28.522
Did you tell Young Lady Jin about it?

43:28.606 --> 43:29.773
No, not yet.

43:30.899 --> 43:32.067
I know I should have told her…

43:34.528 --> 43:35.904
but I just didn't get a chance to.

43:51.045 --> 43:52.171
I knew when I saw you.

43:54.423 --> 43:55.424
You are my master.

44:13.442 --> 44:14.735
I knew when I saw you.

44:15.903 --> 44:16.779
You're my husband.

44:26.121 --> 44:30.042
I appoint Jang Uk of the Jang family
as the general of North Fortress.

44:36.965 --> 44:40.386
Just as Seo Gyeong retreated
to Seoho Fortress

44:40.469 --> 44:42.346
to prevent himself from being a threat,

44:42.429 --> 44:44.139
thus achieving unity.

44:44.223 --> 44:46.100
Jang Uk's retreat to North Fortress

44:46.183 --> 44:48.977
shall also maintain
the peace and stability.

44:50.145 --> 44:53.941
Daeho Fortress will be protected
by me and Cheonbugwan.

44:54.024 --> 44:56.694
We'll soon begin preparations
for the rite of the lake.

44:56.777 --> 44:59.488
So Jang Uk, travel up north
and wait for the black clouds

44:59.571 --> 45:01.115
that will pour down energy on the world.

45:02.783 --> 45:03.659
Yes.

45:03.742 --> 45:05.327
I heard that you were married.

45:06.328 --> 45:07.496
Will your wife go with you?

45:09.623 --> 45:12.668
It's too far away from here,
so she won't be coming.

45:14.545 --> 45:16.255
Your new bride will be
lonely here without you.

45:17.089 --> 45:19.758
In any case,
take care on your journey.

45:20.884 --> 45:21.719
Yes.

45:32.312 --> 45:34.273
Naksu's soul will soon disappear,

45:34.356 --> 45:36.525
and that body will solely
belong to Jin Bu-yeon.

45:38.569 --> 45:40.154
That is what Master Lee told me.

45:41.613 --> 45:43.157
Is her soul really gone

45:43.741 --> 45:45.075
just like he said it would be?

45:53.667 --> 45:54.501
It's not.

45:56.336 --> 45:58.839
If that were true,
she'd return as Bu-yeon.

45:59.882 --> 46:03.093
But that's not yet… my daughter, Bu-yeon.

46:13.937 --> 46:15.230
If he goes to the north…

46:18.233 --> 46:19.401
will I ever see him?

46:21.236 --> 46:23.864
So should I call for her?

46:27.242 --> 46:30.454
The memories I regained
were of someone I liked very much.

46:31.455 --> 46:32.498
I mean, could it be?

46:33.373 --> 46:34.208
Who was it though?

46:34.291 --> 46:36.251
Three years have passed since then.

46:38.253 --> 46:40.130
How could she still be heartbroken?

46:40.214 --> 46:42.216
I actually liked him
more than he liked me.

46:43.258 --> 46:44.885
I guess, yeah, that makes sense, yeah.

46:45.719 --> 46:47.262
It could certainly be a possibility.

46:49.056 --> 46:51.725
But still, how could she toss me aside

46:51.809 --> 46:54.311
after telling me even a brazier
can be missed in the summer?

46:57.981 --> 46:59.983
She's so cold.

47:05.531 --> 47:06.782
You can turn the light on.

47:07.991 --> 47:09.827
You totally deceived me, you know that?

47:09.910 --> 47:10.953
Why would you do this?

47:11.829 --> 47:14.206
You should have remembered
before I fell for you.

47:14.289 --> 47:16.124
How am I supposed
to turn the light back on now?

47:18.001 --> 47:19.002
Even after hearing that…

47:20.838 --> 47:22.297
I still miss her like crazy.

47:24.883 --> 47:27.135
I've informed Young Lady Jin
of your arrival.

47:57.207 --> 48:00.794
Bu-yeon knows
that you're leaving first thing tomorrow.

48:02.546 --> 48:04.590
She told me to tell you
to have a safe trip.

48:04.673 --> 48:05.674
Please tell her that…

48:06.800 --> 48:08.427
I'll come to see her as soon as I return.

48:26.236 --> 48:27.112
Why is…

48:28.739 --> 48:30.032
Jang Uk clinging to her?

48:31.366 --> 48:32.826
And she's rejecting him?

48:50.844 --> 48:51.929
You said

48:52.679 --> 48:53.680
"come in secret."

48:56.224 --> 48:57.684
I took your advice.

48:58.268 --> 49:00.604
I should have destroyed this place
the last time I came here.

49:01.813 --> 49:03.065
Why are you back here?

49:03.649 --> 49:05.108
Because I prefer to stay here.

49:07.402 --> 49:09.446
It's a good place to think by myself.

49:10.322 --> 49:11.365
I thought you were going to leave.

49:12.407 --> 49:13.408
Why are you here?

49:13.492 --> 49:14.952
Because you watched me leave.

49:16.119 --> 49:17.329
I came to show you my face.

49:19.706 --> 49:21.124
I heard you're traveling far.

49:22.167 --> 49:23.251
Goodbye.

49:24.086 --> 49:24.920
"Goodbye"?

49:25.587 --> 49:28.006
I usually have no problem
just leaving people like this.

49:29.341 --> 49:31.468
But I was so dumbfounded
that I had to come ask.

49:31.551 --> 49:32.594
Fine.

49:33.679 --> 49:36.515
You might feel guilty
or even heartbroken after forgetting him.

49:36.598 --> 49:37.432
But then…

49:38.642 --> 49:40.310
why'd you fall for me at first sight?

49:40.894 --> 49:42.479
I wanted to ask if he and I look similar,

49:42.562 --> 49:44.439
but asking that also feels too rude.

49:44.523 --> 49:45.482
Do not ask.

49:46.942 --> 49:48.402
I cannot tell you anything, Jang Uk.

49:48.485 --> 49:49.403
Do we look alike?

49:50.237 --> 49:53.115
Did you fall for me at first sight
because I looked just like that guy?

49:53.198 --> 49:54.408
Then let's say it's so.

49:54.491 --> 49:56.034
I liked you because you looked like him,

49:56.618 --> 49:58.036
you liked me because you were confused.

50:01.665 --> 50:02.916
Let's leave it at that and move on.

50:03.000 --> 50:04.793
But how can I do that? How?

50:05.752 --> 50:07.671
I thought about it over and over again.

50:07.754 --> 50:11.675
The reason I'm staying is not
because I'm confused or even crazy.

50:12.843 --> 50:13.677
It's just…

50:17.347 --> 50:19.433
It's because I liked you so much,
I lost my mind.

50:25.105 --> 50:26.023
You're the one…

50:27.482 --> 50:29.693
who helped me face
the memories that I couldn't before.

50:30.694 --> 50:32.904
You held my hand
when I thought no one would ever again.

50:32.988 --> 50:34.656
You helped me sleep when I could not.

50:34.740 --> 50:35.657
That's why…

50:37.284 --> 50:38.910
I won't be able to stop anymore.

50:40.620 --> 50:43.040
So I'll be the brazier
on a summer day you don't miss.

50:46.334 --> 50:48.128
This time, I'm gonna be the one waiting…

50:51.548 --> 50:52.799
until you finally miss me.

50:58.638 --> 50:59.473
Okay.

51:01.516 --> 51:03.268
I'll come back to you one day.

51:03.935 --> 51:04.853
Take care of yourself.

51:46.394 --> 51:48.188
So, Uk, are you leaving now?

51:48.271 --> 51:49.231
Yes.

51:49.314 --> 51:51.566
Now that the last mage
of Jeongjingak is leaving,

51:51.650 --> 51:55.195
I suppose that place will be
completely empty now.

51:55.278 --> 51:57.072
This just doesn't feel right.

51:57.572 --> 51:59.324
I should go with you, Young Master.

51:59.407 --> 52:00.951
You can't go alone.

52:01.034 --> 52:02.786
But what about me then?

52:04.079 --> 52:06.623
Come on, Maidservant Kim,
my uncle needs you by his side.

52:08.792 --> 52:10.085
Did you meet with her?

52:10.168 --> 52:12.003
She didn't offer to go?

52:12.087 --> 52:14.214
I was sure she would insist
on going with you.

52:14.297 --> 52:16.007
She had her reasons not to.

52:17.843 --> 52:20.470
Is Master Lee not here?
I want to say goodbye to him.

52:20.554 --> 52:24.808
Hmm, he had been treating Yul
at Sejukwon for a few days.

52:25.392 --> 52:28.019
But I guess he must have left again.
I don't see him.

52:28.812 --> 52:29.646
Okay, I see.

52:34.943 --> 52:37.904
Should we not, at least,
tell Uk about Naksu?

52:37.988 --> 52:41.491
I wanted to tell him at first too,
but Lady Jin was against it.

52:42.951 --> 52:45.370
Now that I know
Naksu's soul is going to disappear,

52:45.453 --> 52:48.540
it seems that he may be
better off not knowing.

52:49.124 --> 52:49.958
If he knows…

52:52.169 --> 52:53.920
it will be agonizing for both of them.

52:54.004 --> 52:56.298
Jang Uk will agonize over something

52:56.381 --> 52:58.758
much bigger than
simply losing a loved one.

52:59.968 --> 53:01.553
He possesses the power of Hwansu.

53:01.636 --> 53:04.764
If he really wanted to,
he could get rid of Jin Bu-yeon's soul

53:04.848 --> 53:07.142
from the body
in order to keep Naksu's instead.

53:07.225 --> 53:10.145
But that is forbidden,
just like the alchemy of souls.

53:10.979 --> 53:12.522
That's why it's agonizing.

53:13.398 --> 53:16.902
He won't be able to save her
though he has the power to do so.

53:18.278 --> 53:21.531
Jang Uk will struggle with
having to make an impossible decision…

53:24.159 --> 53:25.827
that no ordinary man would make.

54:00.528 --> 54:01.988
But…

54:02.572 --> 54:05.825
it looks like Uk and Jin Bu-yeon
are having problems.

54:06.952 --> 54:08.370
Young Lady Jin said

54:08.453 --> 54:10.747
Uk went to see Bu-yeon,
but she refused to see him.

54:11.831 --> 54:14.834
Maybe Uk didn't tell her
about going to the North Fortress?

54:24.135 --> 54:27.347
I see you are a sacred animal
with a rare kind of energy.

54:28.431 --> 54:30.976
A turtle that possesses
the power of the Black Tortoise.

54:32.769 --> 54:35.522
They say the Black Tortoise
guides those who are lost

54:35.605 --> 54:37.190
and leads them in the right direction.

54:46.449 --> 54:49.035
I see you're doing your best
to make your way over

54:49.536 --> 54:51.830
to help someone discover their path.

54:55.917 --> 54:59.504
Will Cheonbugwan now begin
preparations for the rite of the lake?

55:00.922 --> 55:03.008
Will your secret organization be involved?

55:04.342 --> 55:07.345
I will soon invite Your Highness
to one of our meetings.

55:08.596 --> 55:11.433
You made me a promise that
I would become as powerful as Jang Uk.

55:13.101 --> 55:14.894
Tell me what you need and I'll help you,

55:15.979 --> 55:17.230
whatever it may be.

55:22.902 --> 55:24.237
What are those things?

55:24.321 --> 55:26.823
Goodness,
there're so many birds.

55:27.866 --> 55:29.784
- What are these? Hm?
- They look very ominous.

55:29.868 --> 55:30.827
Are they birds?

55:31.328 --> 55:32.329
Where do you think
they come from?

55:32.412 --> 55:33.872
What are they doing
in Lake Gyeongcheondaeho?

55:33.955 --> 55:35.874
Uh, this is…
this is very, very strange.

55:35.957 --> 55:39.252
They say hundreds of earthenware
have washed up all over the lake.

55:40.754 --> 55:44.966
They must have all been
discarded for the fear of getting caught.

55:45.050 --> 55:48.720
They seem to be earthenware,
but they feel really ominous.

55:48.803 --> 55:51.639
Now that something
like this has been found,

55:51.723 --> 55:53.433
it will cause an uproar.

55:54.184 --> 55:56.061
No matter
how bad the drought gets,

55:56.144 --> 55:58.104
there is no way the lake will dry.

55:58.188 --> 55:59.606
What are you talking about?

55:59.689 --> 56:04.152
They say the lake once dried up
200 years ago in an awful drought.

56:05.487 --> 56:07.947
- Seriously!
- Ah, shove off!

56:08.031 --> 56:09.199
- What in the world--
- Hey, don't touch it!

56:09.282 --> 56:10.116
Oh, goodness!

56:10.200 --> 56:11.659
Why would you touch it?
We don't know what it is.

56:12.243 --> 56:14.371
Oh, my gosh.
What are they? What are they?

56:14.454 --> 56:19.334
The capital is in an uproar
because of what I discarded in the lake.

56:20.502 --> 56:22.796
Everyone is worried
that the lake will dry up.

56:24.923 --> 56:26.216
That's good to hear then.

56:26.925 --> 56:30.887
Having chaos among the people
will cause the Unanimous Assembly

56:30.970 --> 56:33.098
to actively take part
in the rite for the lake.

56:33.681 --> 56:35.892
Songrim will try
to strengthen their guard.

56:35.975 --> 56:39.562
It will be more difficult to bring
earthenware back from the volcano.

56:46.027 --> 56:47.445
These will be used for the rite.

56:49.406 --> 56:52.867
Bring them along
with the King's gifts from the volcano.

56:54.035 --> 56:57.247
Bringing them that way will prevent
Songrim from doing anything.

56:59.082 --> 57:01.292
We will have to place them
throughout the canals

57:01.376 --> 57:02.377
before the lake's rite.

57:04.129 --> 57:06.923
Would you be able to help with that, Sire?

57:07.006 --> 57:09.759
I'll be sure to inform the men
that stand the Night Watch.

57:10.677 --> 57:12.095
So you may use them.

57:12.178 --> 57:14.514
With the help of the Night Watch,
it will be easy.

57:18.893 --> 57:21.771
Are these objects
for drying up the world as well?

57:21.855 --> 57:25.275
These were only made to help
the real one when it finally emerges.

57:25.358 --> 57:26.526
The real one…

57:27.026 --> 57:29.404
is the fire bird within Jinyowon.

57:30.363 --> 57:32.240
In order for us to achieve that,

57:32.323 --> 57:34.868
we must control Jinyowon
by moving the Assembly.

57:46.004 --> 57:47.839
I wanted to discuss something

57:47.922 --> 57:50.049
before tomorrow's Unanimous Assembly.

57:50.133 --> 57:52.594
You wish to discuss something with me?

57:52.677 --> 57:54.888
The priestess dancing for the rite

57:55.930 --> 57:57.849
is going to be picked from another family.

57:57.932 --> 57:58.766
What?

57:59.893 --> 58:03.813
The dancer for the lake's rite
has always been a Jinyowon priestess.

58:04.439 --> 58:06.191
You can't possibly pick another family.

58:06.274 --> 58:09.277
No one in Jinyowon possesses the power

58:09.360 --> 58:11.529
necessary to perform
the dance for the rite.

58:11.613 --> 58:13.781
I'm capable, so are my two daughters.

58:13.865 --> 58:14.866
Ho-gyeong.

58:15.992 --> 58:18.453
I'm merely giving you
some advance notice here.

58:18.536 --> 58:21.789
The Unanimous Assembly mages
have already decided on this matter.

58:21.873 --> 58:24.209
If you continue
to feed your ego like this,

58:24.292 --> 58:26.753
you'll only end up embarrassing yourself.

58:30.048 --> 58:32.967
You are embarrassing yourself

58:33.635 --> 58:35.386
for Jinyowon will not provide you

58:35.470 --> 58:40.350
with any of its artifacts
needed for the rite of the lake.

58:41.309 --> 58:43.770
Everyone agrees with me on this.

58:43.853 --> 58:45.772
Do you truly think you can do that?

58:45.855 --> 58:48.274
Did you forget we possess the plaque

58:48.358 --> 58:51.194
that gives us the power
to reject the King's orders?

59:08.253 --> 59:09.128
Bu-yeon.

59:09.212 --> 59:10.505
It's suffocating in here.

59:11.089 --> 59:13.049
I'm going to meet Young Master Park.

59:13.132 --> 59:14.884
You should also get some air.

59:15.552 --> 59:16.553
Mother isn't home yet.

59:18.888 --> 59:19.806
I am fine, Cho-yeon.

59:19.889 --> 59:21.015
Young Lady.

59:21.808 --> 59:23.393
Lady Jin has ordered you to come

59:23.893 --> 59:25.478
with the Jinyowon Plaque right now.

59:25.562 --> 59:26.479
Really?

59:31.317 --> 59:32.151
Right now?

59:32.235 --> 59:34.654
She had a heated argument
with Jin Mu, the Gwanju.

59:35.238 --> 59:36.573
You should hurry.

59:38.241 --> 59:40.493
- Did you say Jin Mu of Cheonbugwan?
- Right.

59:44.706 --> 59:46.708
Then I will go instead.

59:46.791 --> 59:47.709
You'll go?

59:49.085 --> 59:50.336
I'm the eldest daughter of our family.

59:52.213 --> 59:55.008
The Jinyowon Plaque is truly valuable.

59:55.592 --> 59:57.093
If I entrust it to you,

59:57.176 --> 59:59.012
I could get scolded by Mother.

01:00:00.388 --> 01:00:02.140
Are you going to be the heir of Jinyowon?

01:00:03.224 --> 01:00:06.185
Then you'll have to
marry a man who will move in.

01:00:06.269 --> 01:00:07.854
And I don't think
Park Dang-gu would do that.

01:00:11.608 --> 01:00:12.442
I will go.

01:00:13.735 --> 01:00:14.569
Okay.

01:00:15.403 --> 01:00:16.404
Then you go.

01:00:27.332 --> 01:00:28.875
Among the memories I've recovered,

01:00:29.917 --> 01:00:31.210
Jin Mu is there as well.

01:00:43.973 --> 01:00:45.475
The one who made me an assassin,

01:00:46.225 --> 01:00:48.686
used me, and killed me.

01:00:50.396 --> 01:00:51.230
And now,

01:00:52.065 --> 01:00:53.066
I am meeting him.

01:00:55.443 --> 01:00:57.487
The Jinyowon Plaque will arrive soon.

01:00:57.570 --> 01:01:00.948
Even that Jinyowon Plaque will
also be taken away tomorrow

01:01:01.032 --> 01:01:02.200
by the Unanimous Assembly.

01:01:02.283 --> 01:01:03.284
You can't do that.

01:01:03.368 --> 01:01:05.119
You could put your precious Jinyowon

01:01:05.203 --> 01:01:07.747
in grave danger
because of personal reasons.

01:01:08.331 --> 01:01:12.752
He said that it's something
that cannot be overlooked.

01:01:12.835 --> 01:01:14.837
- Who in the world--
- I gave the order.

01:01:28.768 --> 01:01:31.646
You made a promise with Songrim
and allowed all of them

01:01:32.230 --> 01:01:34.524
to disturb the fire bird's barrier
inside Jinyowon.

01:01:35.733 --> 01:01:37.527
I was there and I saw it happen.

01:01:38.236 --> 01:01:41.739
But that was a matter
you helped with, Your Royal Highness.

01:01:43.282 --> 01:01:45.743
But in the end, you still allowed them
to meddle with the barrier.

01:01:45.827 --> 01:01:47.995
And since a spell was used in Jinyowon,

01:01:48.079 --> 01:01:50.998
it could very well have awakened
all the artifacts there.

01:01:51.874 --> 01:01:52.792
This is why…

01:01:53.710 --> 01:01:56.254
I stood outside Jinyowon
to prevent exactly that.

01:01:56.879 --> 01:01:59.507
I used my divine powers
in order to keep everything safe.

01:02:00.550 --> 01:02:01.384
Ho-gyeong.

01:02:02.301 --> 01:02:04.387
Your hair has started
to gray around your ears.

01:02:05.722 --> 01:02:08.224
Your powers are not
as strong as they were.

01:02:09.100 --> 01:02:11.686
That's the main reason
we are withdrawing the plaque from you.

01:02:30.371 --> 01:02:31.664
What are you doing over here?

01:02:35.126 --> 01:02:36.169
Were you kicked out?

01:02:40.673 --> 01:02:43.468
Since the plaque's on its way,
you can go ahead and leave it.

01:02:44.051 --> 01:02:46.471
As your brother, I do not wish

01:02:46.554 --> 01:02:49.849
to see you embarrass yourself
in front of everyone here.

01:02:50.600 --> 01:02:53.311
All you've done is
show your already weakened powers,

01:02:53.811 --> 01:02:55.188
so just give up the plaque.

01:03:05.448 --> 01:03:07.200
Jin Bu-yeon from Jinyowon is here.

01:03:14.916 --> 01:03:15.917
Bu-yeon, why are you here?

01:03:23.716 --> 01:03:26.177
I'm the eldest daughter of the Jin family.

01:03:26.260 --> 01:03:27.386
My name is Jin Bu-yeon.

01:03:27.470 --> 01:03:30.014
Jin Cho-yeon couldn't make it,
but Jin Bu-yeon is here.

01:03:30.973 --> 01:03:34.435
Mother, I brought the plaque
that you were asking for.

01:03:50.368 --> 01:03:51.661
Thank you for your trouble.

01:03:52.411 --> 01:03:55.206
Now please leave the plaque
and be on your way.

01:03:55.915 --> 01:03:57.375
Why do we have to leave it here though?

01:03:58.459 --> 01:04:00.545
It is the Jin family's most valuable item.

01:04:00.628 --> 01:04:03.214
Your mother has admitted the fact that

01:04:04.048 --> 01:04:06.467
no one in your family can protect it.

01:04:08.261 --> 01:04:09.095
Ho-gyeong.

01:04:09.178 --> 01:04:11.138
Please put down the plaque right now.

01:04:15.059 --> 01:04:16.561
My duty as the leader

01:04:17.228 --> 01:04:19.105
is to protect this plaque with my life.

01:04:20.314 --> 01:04:23.317
What must I do to change your mind?

01:04:23.401 --> 01:04:26.028
I do not remember
standing upright like that…

01:04:27.405 --> 01:04:30.157
the last time I came
to beg for my life. Do you?

01:04:50.970 --> 01:04:52.972
What if I can prove my abilities to you?

01:04:58.644 --> 01:05:00.354
I'm the heir of Jinyowon.

01:05:01.272 --> 01:05:03.900
I'll show you that
I'm more than capable of keeping it safe.

01:05:05.192 --> 01:05:07.194
I heard you lost
your memory due to illness.

01:05:08.070 --> 01:05:10.489
Does that mean you've also lost

01:05:10.990 --> 01:05:13.242
Jin Seol-ran's divine powers?

01:05:14.243 --> 01:05:16.120
Well then, isn't that a pity for us?

01:05:17.079 --> 01:05:20.499
Both my memories and powers
have started to return.

01:05:21.125 --> 01:05:23.336
Really? Then please allow me to

01:05:23.836 --> 01:05:27.256
test your extraordinary powers.

01:05:27.340 --> 01:05:28.591
Fine. Very well.

01:05:29.842 --> 01:05:31.719
So what do you want me to do to prove it?

01:05:39.143 --> 01:05:43.105
This is the prison of Cheonbugwan
that holds those who performed sorcery.

01:05:43.981 --> 01:05:47.443
Behind that door is
a dark prison called Gwido.

01:05:47.526 --> 01:05:50.821
This very door was created
by the great Jin Seol-ran,

01:05:51.697 --> 01:05:53.157
the first leader of Jinyowon,

01:05:53.240 --> 01:05:54.909
so I'm sure you know it well.

01:05:56.953 --> 01:06:00.915
It's a prison that, so far,
not even a ghost has escaped from.

01:06:00.998 --> 01:06:02.249
What exactly are you doing?

01:06:02.833 --> 01:06:05.044
You mean to say
you'll send Bu-yeon in there?

01:06:05.711 --> 01:06:07.922
I do not mean I will lock her up in there.

01:06:08.547 --> 01:06:10.549
They say Jin Bu-yeon even managed

01:06:10.633 --> 01:06:14.053
to find the ice stone
in Lake Gyeongcheondaeho.

01:06:16.597 --> 01:06:19.058
So I will throw the plaque inside Gwido.

01:06:19.934 --> 01:06:22.937
If she can bring back
the Jinyowon Plaque in a day…

01:06:26.524 --> 01:06:28.651
then I shall acknowledge
your divine powers

01:06:28.734 --> 01:06:30.945
and cancel tomorrow's Unanimous Assembly.

01:06:36.200 --> 01:06:37.159
I will go in there.

01:06:38.077 --> 01:06:39.036
You cannot.

01:06:39.120 --> 01:06:41.539
The wraiths of those
who performed sorcery remain.

01:06:42.039 --> 01:06:43.708
Any of those wraiths could
easily kill you.

01:06:43.791 --> 01:06:45.543
Then you'll let them take
Jinyowon like this?

01:06:54.677 --> 01:06:56.554
Have faith in your daughter's powers.

01:06:59.557 --> 01:07:00.599
You shouldn't worry.

01:07:01.851 --> 01:07:03.102
I'll find it and return.

01:07:08.899 --> 01:07:11.152
Putting the plaque inside
is too dangerous.

01:07:11.235 --> 01:07:14.447
I heard a mage from the Choi family
also died in there 200 years ago.

01:07:14.530 --> 01:07:18.826
What if a priestess
of Jinyowon would also die in there?

01:07:21.287 --> 01:07:23.706
That kind of thought
is a sign of weakness.

01:08:13.798 --> 01:08:16.175
You have until sundown to find the plaque.

01:08:19.553 --> 01:08:20.721
But what do you have there?

01:08:25.559 --> 01:08:26.936
I found it coming here.

01:08:32.274 --> 01:08:35.486
It's an animal with good energy,
so I'd like to take it with me.

01:08:37.822 --> 01:08:38.656
Go ahead.

01:09:23.701 --> 01:09:24.952
He said it's a prison.

01:09:26.245 --> 01:09:27.830
But why is it so big?

01:09:28.914 --> 01:09:31.000
How am I supposed to find
that small plaque here?

01:09:33.919 --> 01:09:35.838
What if it fell into the sea over there?

01:12:29.053 --> 01:12:30.304
You're okay?

01:12:38.020 --> 01:12:38.854
Jang Uk?

01:12:38.937 --> 01:12:40.189
What are you doing here?

01:12:42.858 --> 01:12:44.193
How did you get here?

01:12:45.027 --> 01:12:45.944
More importantly…

01:12:48.197 --> 01:12:49.031
what is that?

01:12:51.158 --> 01:12:51.992
What?

01:12:54.536 --> 01:12:55.829
That thing in your eyes.

01:13:00.209 --> 01:13:01.043
Who…

01:13:03.295 --> 01:13:04.129
are you?

01:13:36.870 --> 01:13:39.832
ALCHEMY OF SOULS
PART 2

01:13:39.915 --> 01:13:42.084
Only I'm allowed to be this close.

01:13:42.167 --> 01:13:44.962
Did you perhaps hear
the sound of bells during that time?

01:13:45.629 --> 01:13:48.757
It will be a world
where the strong gain greater power

01:13:48.841 --> 01:13:52.052
and we'll continue
to hold that power forever!

01:13:52.553 --> 01:13:54.471
You'll have to
eradicate them all to end this.

01:13:54.555 --> 01:13:57.724
Because I, too, will likely
disappear in this place.

01:13:57.808 --> 01:13:59.601
The world
that they've been hoping for

01:13:59.685 --> 01:14:01.603
will never get the chance to exist.

01:14:01.687 --> 01:14:03.564
Is this not the kind of world
you so desperately wanted?

01:14:03.647 --> 01:14:05.774
Get a clear look of what it is like

01:14:05.858 --> 01:14:09.528
for someone with immense strength
to gain and wield even greater power.
